      <div type="clause" n="3.2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIEw">II Ew</ref> 3.2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif he naðor næbbe ne æhta ne oðerne borh, ðonne healde hine man to dome.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If he has neither property nor any other [means of providing] security, then he shall be kept for trial.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif he naðor næbbe ne æhta ne oðerne borh, ðone healde hine man to dome.</ab>
